From 064541ca32d2cfc4bf712f97af2d56397f57f8b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kulesha Evgeniy <voovdop@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:18:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/9] turnip/a5xx: add WSI, CPU copies and indexed draws

Add the a5xx WSI path, CPU fallbacks for buffer/image copies and clears, UCHE cache maintenance on map/unmap, linear-only DRM modifiers, graphics UBO pointer upload, vkCmdBindIndexBuffer and CPU expansion of indexed draws.

Signed-off-by: Kulesha Evgeniy <voovdop@gmail.com>
